    "notes": "Original PAL 1927 laboratory building: flat-roof wings, central clock stair tower, recessed entry, glazed rooflight hall. Preserve reentrant courts and keep adjacent former hospital buildings separate.",
    "surveySource": "https://api.pdok.nl/kadaster/bag/ogc/v2/collections/pand/items",
    "surveyFetched": "2026-10-04",
    "architectureReferences": [
