      "https://www.lab111.nl/over-ons/",
      "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/Arie_Biemondstraat_105.jpg"
    ],
    "reconstructionNotes": "RCE monument 524816: 1927 Hulshoff laboratory, unequal flat-roof wings, eleven-bay front, central clock/stair tower with tall gridded windows and sculptural cornice. Current BAG recess remains open; mapped max 22.1 m bounds clock-tower cap. Native frontage follows Arie Biemondstraat south of the plot, parallel to main canal-side wing."
